@page "/components/datatable"
@using System.Text.Encodings.Web
@using RizzyUI.Docs.Components.Examples

<PageTitle>DataTable</PageTitle>

<RzQuickReferenceContainer>
    <RzArticle ProseWidth="ProseWidth.UltraWide">
        <SideContent>
            <RzQuickReference />
        </SideContent>
        <MainContent>
            <RzBreadcrumb class="mb-4 not-prose">
                <BreadcrumbList>
                    <BreadcrumbItem><BreadcrumbLink Href="/">Docs</BreadcrumbLink></BreadcrumbItem>
                    <BreadcrumbSeparator />
                    <BreadcrumbItem><BreadcrumbLink Href="/components">Components</BreadcrumbLink></BreadcrumbItem>
                    <BreadcrumbSeparator />
                    <BreadcrumbItem><BreadcrumbPage>DataTable</BreadcrumbPage></BreadcrumbItem>
                </BreadcrumbList>
            </RzBreadcrumb>

            <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H1" QuickReferenceTitle="DataTable" class="scroll-mt-20">DataTable</RzHeading>
            <RzParagraph>
                <code>RzDataTable</code> adds sorting, filtering, pagination, row selection and column visibility to a table
                that you write. You pass the rows and column definitions from C#, and the table runs in the browser: sorting,
                filtering or changing pages needs no request to the server.
            </RzParagraph>

            <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="How it works" class="mt-8 scroll-mt-20" Id="how-it-works">How it works</RzHeading>
            <ol class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-6">
                <li>
                    Give <code>RzDataTable</code> your rows in <code>Items</code>, a <code>Config</code> with the columns
                    and features you want, and a <code>RowIdSelector</code> that returns each row's unique id.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Inside it, write the table, usually with <code>RzTable</code>. Loop over <code>headerGroups</code> and
                    <code>rows</code> with Alpine's <code>x-for</code>, and put
                    <code class="whitespace-nowrap">x-flexrender="_flex.cell(cell)"</code> on the element that shows each cell.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Add the controls you need: a sort button in a header, a filter input, page links, checkboxes.
                    Helper components such as <code>DataTableSortToggle</code> and
                    <code>DataTableRowSelectCheckbox</code> cover the common ones.
                </li>
            </ol>
            <RzParagraph>
                The <a href="#basic-usage" class="underline underline-offset-4">basic example</a> below is a complete table; each
                section after it adds one feature. Because you write the markup, a row can look like anything you like.
                <a href="#architecture-and-author-responsibilities" class="underline underline-offset-4">Why you write the table</a>
                explains the split.
            </RzParagraph>

            <RzAlert class="my-4" Variant="ThemeVariant.Warning">
                <AlertTitle>Everything in Items is sent to the browser</AlertTitle>
                <AlertDescription>
                    Every property of every item can be read in the page, including properties you don't show as columns.
                    Pass a small class with only the fields the table needs, and leave out rows the user may not see. See
                    <a href="#client-data-and-dtos" class="underline underline-offset-4">Client data and DTOs</a>.
                </AlertDescription>
            </RzAlert>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Basic usage" class="scroll-mt-20" Id="basic-usage">Basic usage</RzHeading>
                    <div>
                        <RzDataTable Items="_users" Config="_config" RowIdSelector="x => x.Id">
                            <RzTable Border>
                                <TableHeader>
                                    <template x-for="headerGroup in headerGroups" :key="headerGroup.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="header in headerGroup.headers" :key="header.id">
                                                <TableHeaderCell x-bind:colspan="header.colSpan">
                                                    <template x-if="!header.isPlaceholder">
                                                        <span x-flexrender="_flex.header(header)"></span>
                                                    </template>
                                                </TableHeaderCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableHeader>
                                <TableBody>
                                    <template x-for="row in rows" :key="row.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="cell in row.cells" :key="cell.id">
                                                <TableCell x-flexrender="_flex.cell(cell)"></TableCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableBody>
                            </RzTable>
                        </RzDataTable>
                    </div>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_basicUsageCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Empty state" class="scroll-mt-20">Empty state</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>Empty state is consumer-authored and driven by <code>isEmpty</code>.</RzParagraph>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_emptyStateCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Global filter" class="scroll-mt-20">Global filter</RzHeading>
                    <div>
                        <RzDataTable Items="_users" Config="_config" RowIdSelector="x => x.Id">
                            <label for="datatable-filter" class="text-sm font-medium">Filter users</label>
                            <input id="datatable-filter" class="border px-2 py-1 rounded" placeholder="Search name" x-on:input="filter.setGlobalFilter($event.target.value)" />

                            <RzTable Border>
                                <TableHeader>
                                    <template x-for="headerGroup in headerGroups" :key="headerGroup.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="header in headerGroup.headers" :key="header.id">
                                                <TableHeaderCell x-bind:colspan="header.colSpan">
                                                    <template x-if="!header.isPlaceholder">
                                                        <span x-flexrender="_flex.header(header)"></span>
                                                    </template>
                                                </TableHeaderCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableHeader>
                                <TableBody>
                                    <template x-if="isEmpty">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <TableCell colspan="2" class="text-center">No results found.</TableCell>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                    <template x-for="row in rows" :key="row.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="cell in row.cells" :key="cell.id">
                                                <TableCell x-flexrender="_flex.cell(cell)"></TableCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableBody>
                            </RzTable>
                        </RzDataTable>
                    </div>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_globalFilterCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Pagination with previous and next" class="scroll-mt-20">Pagination with previous and next</RzHeading>
                    <div>
                        <RzDataTable Items="_users" Config="_config" RowIdSelector="x => x.Id">
                            <RzTable Border>
                                <TableHeader>
                                    <template x-for="headerGroup in headerGroups" :key="headerGroup.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="header in headerGroup.headers" :key="header.id">
                                                <TableHeaderCell x-bind:colspan="header.colSpan">
                                                    <template x-if="!header.isPlaceholder">
                                                        <span x-flexrender="_flex.header(header)"></span>
                                                    </template>
                                                </TableHeaderCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableHeader>
                                <TableBody>
                                    <template x-for="row in rows" :key="row.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="cell in row.cells" :key="cell.id">
                                                <TableCell x-flexrender="_flex.cell(cell)"></TableCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableBody>
                            </RzTable>

                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                                    Page <span x-text="pagination.pageIndex + 1"></span> of <span x-text="pagination.pageCount"></span>
                                </p>

                                <RzPagination x-show="pagination.pageCount > 1">
                                    <PaginationList>
                                        <PaginationItem>
                                            <PaginationPrevious Href="#"
                                                                x-on:click.prevent="pagination.previousPage()"
                                                                x-bind:aria-disabled="!pagination.canPreviousPage"
                                                                x-bind:tabindex="pagination.canPreviousPage ? null : -1"
                                                                x-bind:class="!pagination.canPreviousPage ? 'pointer-events-none opacity-50' : ''" />
                                        </PaginationItem>
                                        <PaginationItem>
                                            <PaginationNext Href="#"
                                                            x-on:click.prevent="pagination.nextPage()"
                                                            x-bind:aria-disabled="!pagination.canNextPage"
                                                            x-bind:tabindex="pagination.canNextPage ? null : -1"
                                                            x-bind:class="!pagination.canNextPage ? 'pointer-events-none opacity-50' : ''" />
                                        </PaginationItem>
                                    </PaginationList>
                                </RzPagination>
                            </div>
                        </RzDataTable>
                    </div>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_paginationPreviousNextCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Pagination with page links" class="scroll-mt-20">Pagination with page links</RzHeading>
                    <div>
                        <RzDataTable Items="_users" Config="_config" RowIdSelector="x => x.Id">
                            <RzTable Border>
                                <TableHeader>
                                    <template x-for="headerGroup in headerGroups" :key="headerGroup.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="header in headerGroup.headers" :key="header.id">
                                                <TableHeaderCell x-bind:colspan="header.colSpan">
                                                    <template x-if="!header.isPlaceholder">
                                                        <span x-flexrender="_flex.header(header)"></span>
                                                    </template>
                                                </TableHeaderCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableHeader>
                                <TableBody>
                                    <template x-for="row in rows" :key="row.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="cell in row.cells" :key="cell.id">
                                                <TableCell x-flexrender="_flex.cell(cell)"></TableCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableBody>
                            </RzTable>

                            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
                                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                                    Showing <span x-text="pagination.startRow"></span> to <span x-text="pagination.endRow"></span> of <span x-text="pagination.totalRows"></span> results
                                </p>

                                <RzPagination x-show="pagination.pageCount > 1">
                                    <PaginationList>
                                        <PaginationItem>
                                            <PaginationPrevious Href="#"
                                                                x-on:click.prevent="pagination.previousPage()"
                                                                x-bind:aria-disabled="!pagination.canPreviousPage"
                                                                x-bind:tabindex="pagination.canPreviousPage ? null : -1"
                                                                x-bind:class="!pagination.canPreviousPage ? 'pointer-events-none opacity-50' : ''" />
                                        </PaginationItem>

                                        <template x-for="item in pagination.items" :key="item.id">
                                            <PaginationItem>
                                                <template x-if="item.kind === 'page'">
                                                    <PaginationLink Href="#"
                                                                    x-text="item.label"
                                                                    x-on:click.prevent="pagination.setPageIndex(item.pageIndex)"
                                                                    x-bind:aria-current="item.isActive ? 'page' : null"
                                                                    x-bind:class="item.isActive ? 'pointer-events-none bg-accent text-accent-foreground' : ''" />
                                                </template>
                                                <template x-if="item.kind === 'ellipsis'">
                                                    <PaginationEllipsis />
                                                </template>
                                            </PaginationItem>
                                        </template>

                                        <PaginationItem>
                                            <PaginationNext Href="#"
                                                            x-on:click.prevent="pagination.nextPage()"
                                                            x-bind:aria-disabled="!pagination.canNextPage"
                                                            x-bind:tabindex="pagination.canNextPage ? null : -1"
                                                            x-bind:class="!pagination.canNextPage ? 'pointer-events-none opacity-50' : ''" />
                                        </PaginationItem>
                                    </PaginationList>
                                </RzPagination>
                            </div>
                        </RzDataTable>
                    </div>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_paginationPageLinksCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Column visibility" class="scroll-mt-20">Column visibility</RzHeading>
                    <div class="min-h-96">
                        <RzDataTable Items="_users" Config="_config" RowIdSelector="x => x.Id">
                            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
                                <label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium">
                                    <input type="checkbox"
                                           x-bind:checked="columns.getIsAllColumnsVisible()"
                                           x-indeterminate="columns.getIsSomeColumnsVisible() && !columns.getIsAllColumnsVisible()"
                                           x-on:change="columns.toggleAllColumnsVisible($event.target.checked)" />
                                    Toggle all columns
                                </label>

                                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                                    <template x-for="column in columns.leaf" :key="column.id">
                                        <label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
                                            <input type="checkbox"
                                                   x-bind:checked="columns.getIsVisible(column)"
                                                   x-bind:disabled="!columns.getCanHide(column)"
                                                   x-on:change="columns.toggleVisibility(column, $event.target.checked)" />
                                            <span x-text="column.id"></span>
                                        </label>
                                    </template>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <RzTable Border>
                                <TableHeader>
                                    <template x-for="headerGroup in headerGroups" :key="headerGroup.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="header in headerGroup.headers" :key="header.id">
                                                <TableHeaderCell x-bind:colspan="header.colSpan">
                                                    <template x-if="!header.isPlaceholder">
                                                        <span x-flexrender="_flex.header(header)"></span>
                                                    </template>
                                                </TableHeaderCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableHeader>
                                <TableBody>
                                    <template x-for="row in rows" :key="row.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="cell in row.cells" :key="cell.id">
                                                <TableCell x-flexrender="_flex.cell(cell)"></TableCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableBody>
                            </RzTable>
                        </RzDataTable>
                    </div>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_columnVisibilityCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Sorting" class="scroll-mt-20">Sorting</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    <code>DataTableSortIcon</code> supports custom icons via <code>AscendingIcon</code>, <code>DescendingIcon</code>, and <code>UnsortedIcon</code>.
                </RzParagraph>
                    <div class="min-h-96">
                        <RzDataTable Items="_users" Config="_config" RowIdSelector="x => x.Id">
                            <RzTable Border>
                                <TableHeader>
                                    <template x-for="headerGroup in headerGroups" :key="headerGroup.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="header in headerGroup.headers" :key="header.id">
                                                <TableHeaderCell x-bind:colspan="header.colSpan"
                                                                 x-bind:aria-sort="sort.ariaSort(header)">
                                                    <template x-if="!header.isPlaceholder">
                                                        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
                                                            <span x-flexrender="_flex.header(header)"></span>
                                                            <DataTableSortToggle HeaderExpr="header" RenderLabel="false" />
                                                        </div>
                                                    </template>
                                                </TableHeaderCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableHeader>
                                <TableBody>
                                    <template x-for="row in rows" :key="row.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="cell in row.cells" :key="cell.id">
                                                <TableCell x-flexrender="_flex.cell(cell)"></TableCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableBody>
                            </RzTable>
                        </RzDataTable>
                    </div>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_sortingHelpersCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Row selection" class="scroll-mt-20">Row selection</RzHeading>
                    <div class="min-h-96">
                        <RzDataTable Items="_users" Config="_config" RowIdSelector="x => x.Id">
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                                Selected rows: <span x-text="selectedRowCount"></span>
                            </p>

                            <RzTable Border>
                                <TableHeader>
                                    <template x-for="headerGroup in headerGroups" :key="headerGroup.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <TableHeaderCell class="w-10 text-center">
                                                <DataTableSelectAllCheckbox Scope="DataTableSelectionScope.Page" />
                                            </TableHeaderCell>
                                            <template x-for="header in headerGroup.headers" :key="header.id">
                                                <TableHeaderCell x-bind:colspan="header.colSpan">
                                                    <template x-if="!header.isPlaceholder">
                                                        <span x-flexrender="_flex.header(header)"></span>
                                                    </template>
                                                </TableHeaderCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableHeader>
                                <TableBody>
                                    <template x-for="row in rows" :key="row.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <TableCell class="w-10 text-center">
                                                <DataTableRowSelectCheckbox RowExpr="row.row" />
                                            </TableCell>
                                            <template x-for="cell in row.cells" :key="cell.id">
                                                <TableCell x-flexrender="_flex.cell(cell)"></TableCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableBody>
                            </RzTable>
                        </RzDataTable>
                    </div>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_rowSelectionCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Row selection column" class="scroll-mt-20">Row selection column</RzHeading>
                    <div class="min-h-96">
                        <RzDataTable Items="_users" Config="_config" RowIdSelector="x => x.Id">
                            <RzTable Border>
                                <TableHeader>
                                    <template x-for="headerGroup in headerGroups" :key="headerGroup.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <DataTableSelectionHeaderCell Scope="DataTableSelectionScope.Page" />

                                            <template x-for="header in headerGroup.headers" :key="header.id">
                                                <TableHeaderCell x-bind:colspan="header.colSpan"
                                                                 x-bind:aria-sort="sort.ariaSort(header)">
                                                    <template x-if="!header.isPlaceholder">
                                                        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
                                                            <span x-flexrender="_flex.header(header)"></span>
                                                            <DataTableSortToggle HeaderExpr="header" RenderLabel="false" />
                                                        </div>
                                                    </template>
                                                </TableHeaderCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableHeader>

                                <TableBody>
                                    <template x-for="row in rows" :key="row.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <DataTableSelectionCell RowExpr="row.row" />

                                            <template x-for="cell in row.cells" :key="cell.id">
                                                <TableCell x-flexrender="_flex.cell(cell)"></TableCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableBody>
                            </RzTable>
                        </RzDataTable>
                    </div>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_rowSelectionColumnCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Grouped columns and custom cells" class="scroll-mt-20">Grouped columns and custom cells</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    Columns can be grouped (<code>Columns</code> on a column), which produces one header row per level. Each header and
                    cell is yours to render: branch on <code>header.column.id</code> or <code>cell.column.id</code> with
                    <code>template x-if</code> and render anything, or fall back to <code>x-flexrender</code>. Here the Name header uses the
                    sort helpers and the Email cell is a link.
                </RzParagraph>
                    <div>
                        <RzDataTable Items="_users" Config="_groupedConfig" RowIdSelector="x => x.Id">
                            <RzTable Border>
                                <TableCaption>Users, grouped columns</TableCaption>
                                <TableHeader>
                                    <template x-for="headerGroup in headerGroups" :key="headerGroup.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="header in headerGroup.headers" :key="header.id">
                                                <TableHeaderCell x-bind:colspan="header.colSpan" x-bind:aria-sort="sort.can(header) ? sort.ariaSort(header) : null">
                                                    <template x-if="sort.can(header) && !header.isPlaceholder">
                                                        <DataTableSortToggle HeaderExpr="header" />
                                                    </template>
                                                    <template x-if="!sort.can(header) && !header.isPlaceholder">
                                                        <span x-flexrender="_flex.header(header)"></span>
                                                    </template>
                                                </TableHeaderCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableHeader>
                                <TableBody>
                                    <template x-for="row in rows" :key="row.id">
                                        <TableRow>
                                            <template x-for="cell in row.cells" :key="cell.id">
                                                <TableCell>
                                                    <template x-if="cell.column.id === 'Email'">
                                                        <a class="underline underline-offset-4" x-bind:href="'mailto:' + cell.getValue()" x-text="cell.getValue()"></a>
                                                    </template>
                                                    <template x-if="cell.column.id !== 'Email'">
                                                        <span x-flexrender="_flex.cell(cell)"></span>
                                                    </template>
                                                </TableCell>
                                            </template>
                                        </TableRow>
                                    </template>
                                </TableBody>
                            </RzTable>
                        </RzDataTable>
                    </div>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_groupedCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Client data and DTOs" class="scroll-mt-20" Id="client-data-and-dtos">Client data and DTOs</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    The table runs in the browser, so <code>Items</code> is serialized into the page. Every serializable property of
                    every item can be read there, whether or not a column shows it; hiding a column is presentation, not access
                    control. You decide what is sent: pass a DTO or view model with the fields the table needs, and apply authorization
                    (which rows, which fields) before the data reaches <code>RzDataTable</code>. RizzyUI does not try to work out which
                    fields are sensitive.
                </RzParagraph>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.CSharp">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_dtoCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Responding to events" class="scroll-mt-20">Responding to events</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    The runtime dispatches bubbling <code>rz:datatable:*</code> events with serializable details that include the
                    table's <code>componentId</code> (its <code>Id</code>), so one listener can serve several tables. A module script with
                    the request nonce works with a strict CSP.
                </RzParagraph>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_eventsCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="htmx swaps" class="scroll-mt-20">htmx swaps</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    Render the whole table from an endpoint and swap it with htmx. A table that is swapped in initializes itself and
                    raises <code>rz:datatable:ready</code>; one that is removed is cleaned up. Sorting, page and selection belong to the
                    table instance, so a replacement starts from <code>InitialState</code>: put the state you want to keep there (for
                    example the current sort from the request).
                </RzParagraph>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_htmxCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="htmx in rows" class="scroll-mt-20">htmx in rows</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    Rows are rendered by Alpine from the row template, after htmx processed the page. The table processes the rows it
                    renders, so <code>hx-*</code> attributes in a row template work: bind a per-row URL with
                    <code>x-bind:hx-get="row.row.original.editUrl"</code> and add <code>hx-target</code> as usual. Components inside an
                    <code>x-for</code> template would repeat their generated id in every row, so the copies drop it; give an element an
                    id per row with <code>x-bind:id</code> when you need one.
                </RzParagraph>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Keeping the state across server rebuilds" class="scroll-mt-20">Keeping the state across server rebuilds</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    Set <code>StateInputName</code> and the table keeps one hidden input (id <code>{Id}-state</code>) with its sorting,
                    page, filters and column visibility as versioned JSON; <code>IncludeSelectionInState</code> adds the selected row
                    ids. Include the input in requests that rebuild the table, bind it as <code>RzDataTableState</code>, and render the
                    new table from <code>ToInitialState()</code>: the user keeps their place. What you accept from the state (page sizes,
                    columns) is up to the action.
                </RzParagraph>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor" ViewerTitle="Table">
&lt;RzDataTable TItem="PersonRow" Id="people" Items="Rows" Config="Config" RowIdSelector="x =&gt; x.Id"
             StateInputName="TableState" IncludeSelectionInState="true"&gt;...&lt;/RzDataTable&gt;

&lt;select name="Status" hx-get="/people/table" hx-target="#people-region" hx-include="#people-state"&gt;...&lt;/select&gt;
                </RzCodeViewer>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.CSharp" ViewerTitle="Action" class="mt-4">
[HttpGet("/people/table")]
public async Task&lt;IResult&gt; Table(string? status, [FromQuery(Name = "TableState")] RzDataTableState? state)
{
    var initial = state?.ToInitialState() ?? new RzDataTableInitialState();
    return PartialView&lt;PeopleTable&gt;(new { Rows = await LoadAsync(status), State = initial });
}
// state.SelectedRowIds lists the selected rows (with IncludeSelectionInState), for bulk actions.
                </RzCodeViewer>
                <RzParagraph class="mt-4">
                    MVC binds the input with the parameter's name; minimal APIs bind it through <code>RzDataTableState.TryParse</code>.
                    A missing or unreadable value binds <code>null</code>. <code>TableRequestModel</code> is obsolete and will be removed after 1.0.
                </RzParagraph>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Architecture and author responsibilities" class="scroll-mt-20" Id="architecture-and-author-responsibilities">Architecture and author responsibilities</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    <code>RzDataTable&lt;TItem&gt;</code> owns data transport and TanStack state; it does not generate the visible table, rows, or cells for you.
                    Author the table in <code>ChildContent</code> and bind it to the runtime projections.
                </RzParagraph>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li>Use <code>RzTable</code>, <code>TableHeader</code>, <code>TableBody</code>, <code>TableRow</code>, <code>TableHeaderCell</code>, and <code>TableCell</code> when you want native table semantics.</li>
                    <li>Loop over <code>headerGroups</code>, <code>rows</code>, and <code>footerGroups</code> with Alpine <code>template x-for</code> blocks and stable keys.</li>
                    <li>Render TanStack content with <code>x-flexrender="_flex.header(header)"</code>, <code>x-flexrender="_flex.cell(cell)"</code>, or <code>x-flexrender="_flex.footer(footer)"</code> on the authored element that should receive the rendered content.</li>
                    <li>Keep <code>RowIdSelector</code> stable and unique because the server and runtime both reject duplicate or empty row ids.</li>
                    <li>Add accessible labels, captions, filter labels, pagination labels, and current/disabled states in your authored markup when the helper components do not provide them automatically.</li>
                </ul>
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H3" class="mt-6">Why you write the table</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    The state of a data table (which rows, in which order, which page, what is selected or hidden) is the same whatever
                    the table looks like; the presentation is not. Keeping them apart lets you build a plain semantic table, a dense
                    list, rows with inline actions or rich cells on one state engine, use <code>RzTable</code> or your own markup, and
                    change the layout without touching sorting or selection.
                </RzParagraph>
                <div class="not-prose my-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
                    <table class="w-full text-sm">
                        <thead class="bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900">
                            <tr><th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium">RzDataTable provides</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-medium">You control</th></tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody class="divide-y divide-zinc-200 dark:divide-zinc-800">
                            <tr class="align-top"><td class="px-4 py-3">TanStack state and algorithms: sorting, filtering, pagination, selection, column visibility, header groups</td><td class="px-4 py-3">The table structure, captions and labels</td></tr>
                            <tr class="align-top"><td class="px-4 py-3">Reactive projections: <code>headerGroups</code>, <code>rows</code>, <code>footerGroups</code>, <code>pagination</code>, ...</td><td class="px-4 py-3">How each header and cell is rendered</td></tr>
                            <tr class="align-top"><td class="px-4 py-3">Helper APIs (<code>sort</code>, <code>selection</code>, <code>pagination</code>, <code>filter</code>, <code>columns</code>) and accessible helper components</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Which controls exist and where (filter inputs, pagination, column menus)</td></tr>
                            <tr class="align-top"><td class="px-4 py-3"><code>rz:datatable:*</code> events and live announcements</td><td class="px-4 py-3">Which data is sent (<code>Items</code>) and how the page reacts to events</td></tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
                <RzParagraph>
                    The engineering contract (responsibilities, design boundaries, what must stay stable) is in
                    <a href="https://github.com/JalexSocial/RizzyUI/blob/main/docs/engineering/rzdatatable-architecture.md" class="underline underline-offset-4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">RzDataTable architecture</a>.
                </RzParagraph>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Accessibility" class="scroll-mt-20">Accessibility</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    DataTable follows an enhanced semantic table-composition model. It preserves native table semantics from the authored markup and augments focused controls for sorting, selection, filtering, pagination, and column visibility. It intentionally does not implement the WAI-ARIA grid pattern.
                </RzParagraph>
                <RzParagraph>
                    The <a href="/components/datatable/accessibility-mode" class="underline underline-offset-4">DataTable accessibility mode design note</a>
                    explains this decision and lists the behavior that must be preserved.
                </RzParagraph>

                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H3">Semantic table composition</RzHeading>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li>The DataTable root is a neutral shell; it does not add <code>role="grid"</code>, generated row roles, generated cell roles, or an active-descendant model.</li>
                    <li>When you use <code>RzTable</code> and table subcomponents, the rendered structure remains a real <code>table</code> with native <code>thead</code>, <code>tbody</code>, <code>tr</code>, <code>th</code>, <code>td</code>, <code>caption</code>, and <code>tfoot</code> elements.</li>
                    <li>Sortable headers should keep <code>TableHeaderCell</code> semantics and bind <code>x-bind:aria-sort="sort.ariaSort(header)"</code> on the header cell that represents the sorted column.</li>
                    <li>Selection should use native checkbox inputs through <code>DataTableSelectAllCheckbox</code>, <code>DataTableRowSelectCheckbox</code>, <code>DataTableSelectionHeaderCell</code>, or <code>DataTableSelectionCell</code>.</li>
                </ul>

                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H3">Sorting, selection, pagination, filtering, and visibility</RzHeading>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li><strong>Sorting:</strong> <code>DataTableSortToggle</code> renders a native <code>button</code>, binds disabled state to <code>!sort.can(header)</code>, is named by its visible label (the column; give the header cell <code>aria-sort</code> for the direction, and an icon-only toggle gets the column name from <code>sort.columnName(header)</code>), exposes <code>data-sort-direction</code>, and calls <code>sort.toggle(header)</code>.</li>
                    <li><strong>Selection:</strong> selection helpers render native checkboxes with <code>aria-label</code>, checked/disabled bindings, indeterminate state effects, and change handlers that update TanStack row selection state.</li>
                    <li><strong>Pagination:</strong> the runtime exposes page state and methods. Examples bind unavailable links with <code>aria-disabled</code>, remove them from the tab order with <code>tabindex="-1"</code>, and mark the active page with <code>aria-current="page"</code>.</li>
                    <li><strong>Filtering:</strong> the runtime exposes <code>filter.globalFilter</code> and <code>filter.setGlobalFilter(value)</code>. Authors must provide the visible label or accessible name for filter inputs.</li>
                    <li><strong>Column visibility:</strong> the runtime exposes <code>columns.*</code> state and helpers. Authors must label visibility toggles and preserve checkbox semantics.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Keyboard interaction" class="scroll-mt-20">Keyboard Interaction</RzHeading>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li><kbd>Tab</kbd> and <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>Tab</kbd> move through authored focusable controls in DOM order, such as sort buttons, selection checkboxes, filter inputs, column visibility checkboxes, and pagination links.</li>
                    <li><kbd>Enter</kbd> or <kbd>Space</kbd> activates native sort buttons rendered by <code>DataTableSortToggle</code>.</li>
                    <li><kbd>Space</kbd> toggles native selection and visibility checkboxes.</li>
                    <li><kbd>Enter</kbd> activates pagination links when the authored link is enabled; disabled examples use <code>aria-disabled="true"</code> and <code>tabindex="-1"</code>.</li>
                    <li>Arrow-key cell navigation, Home/End grid navigation, Page Up/Page Down grid navigation, roving <code>tabindex</code>, and <code>aria-activedescendant</code> are not implemented by <code>RzDataTable&lt;TItem&gt;</code>.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Focus management" class="scroll-mt-20">Focus Management</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    DataTable does not move focus after sorting, filtering, pagination, selection, or column visibility changes. Focus remains with the native control that the user operated unless your authored markup or browser behavior changes it.
                </RzParagraph>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li>No focus trap is created.</li>
                    <li>No initial focus target is assigned by the DataTable shell.</li>
                    <li>No focus restoration is attempted after state changes.</li>
                    <li>Because authors own <code>ChildContent</code>, authors also own any additional focus behavior introduced by custom controls.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Screen reader behavior" class="scroll-mt-20">Screen Reader Behavior</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    The DataTable shell includes a visually hidden status region with <code>role="status"</code>, <code>aria-live="polite"</code>, and <code>aria-atomic="true"</code>. The runtime updates it only when a relevant state slice actually changes.
                </RzParagraph>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li>Sorting changes announce summaries such as an active ascending or descending sort, or that sorting has been cleared.</li>
                    <li>Pagination changes announce the page number, page count, visible row range, and total rows.</li>
                    <li>Filtering changes announce whether filters are applied and the current matching-row count.</li>
                    <li>Selection changes announce the selected-row count.</li>
                    <li>Column visibility changes announce how many columns are visible.</li>
                    <li>Announcements are polite, not assertive, and repeated identical messages are suppressed.</li>
                    <li>The runtime also dispatches <code>rz:datatable:announcement</code> with serializable detail containing <code>message</code>, <code>politeness</code>, and <code>reason</code>.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="SSR and CSP behavior" class="scroll-mt-20">SSR/CSP Behavior</RzHeading>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li>The server output contains the shell, <code>data-config-id</code>, and an inert <code>script type="application/json"</code> with serialized transport data.</li>
                    <li>The Alpine runtime <code>rzDataTable</code> reads that config by id, creates the TanStack Table instance, and dispatches browser <code>rz:</code> custom events.</li>
                    <li>No Blazor <code>EventCallback</code>, <code>@@onclick</code>, <code>@@onchange</code>, <code>@@bind</code>, or interactive circuit is required for DataTable behavior.</li>
                    <li>The table runtime is loaded on demand (<code>LoadStrategy</code>), with both the standard and the CSP build.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Strict CSP" class="scroll-mt-20" Id="strict-csp">Strict CSP</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>
                    Load the CSP build of the runtime with the request nonce. The DataTable runtime, its helper components and every
                    example on this page then work under a policy without <code>unsafe-eval</code> or <code>unsafe-inline</code>; the
                    integration tests run them in the browser with both builds.
                </RzParagraph>
                <RzCodeViewer Language="@CodeLanguage.Razor">
                    @((MarkupString)EncodeCode(_cspCode))
                </RzCodeViewer>
                <RzParagraph class="mt-4">
                    The CSP build evaluates Alpine expressions without <code>eval</code>, so it accepts a subset of JavaScript. Tested
                    with the Alpine version RizzyUI ships:
                </RzParagraph>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li><strong>Works:</strong> property reads (<code>pagination.canNextPage</code>), method calls with arguments
                        (<code>sort.ariaSort(header)</code>, <code>filter.setGlobalFilter($event.target.value)</code>), comparisons and
                        <code>&amp;&amp;</code>, <code>||</code>, <code>!</code>, ternaries (<code>item.isActive ? 'page' : null</code>),
                        arithmetic and string concatenation (<code>pagination.pageIndex + 1</code>), <code>x-for</code>, <code>x-if</code>,
                        <code>:key</code> and <code>x-flexrender</code>.</li>
                    <li><strong>Does not work:</strong> assigning to a property. <code>x-model="filter.globalFilter"</code> and
                        <code>x-effect="$el.indeterminate = ..."</code> both assign; use a method
                        (<code>x-on:input="filter.setGlobalFilter($event.target.value)"</code>) and
                        <code>x-indeterminate="..."</code> instead. Bind <code>x-bind:style</code> to an object, not a string.</li>
                    <li>RizzyUI is responsible for its runtime, helpers and documented patterns. Expressions you write yourself must
                        follow these rules; move anything more complex into a method of your own Alpine component.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Known limitations" class="scroll-mt-20">Known Limitations</RzHeading>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li><code>RzDataTable&lt;TItem&gt;</code> is not an ARIA grid and should not be documented or consumed as one.</li>
                    <li>Grid-style cell navigation, roving focus, active-descendant focus, row/column count ARIA, and cell-level selection semantics are not provided.</li>
                    <li>The shell cannot verify every possible <code>ChildContent</code> composition, so authors must preserve semantic table structure, labels, captions, and relationships in custom markup.</li>
                    <li>Generated <code>rowSelection</code> cell renderers produce checkbox HTML for convenience; use the Razor selection helper components when you need more control over surrounding table semantics or labels.</li>
                    <li>The runtime is client-side TanStack state only. It does not perform server paging, server filtering, or server sorting by itself.</li>
                    <li>Under the CSP build, your own expressions in <code>ChildContent</code> must follow the rules in <a href="#strict-csp" class="underline underline-offset-4">Strict CSP</a>; RizzyUI cannot rewrite them.</li>
                    <li><code>flex.html(...)</code> inserts HTML as is. Return it only for trusted content; the built-in renderers use text, and the generated <code>rowSelection</code> cell escapes the row id.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Component parameters" class="scroll-mt-20">Component parameters</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph>Configure <code>RzDataTable&lt;TItem&gt;</code> with row data, a stable row id selector, and a TanStack-oriented configuration object.</RzParagraph>
                <div class="not-prose mt-6 mb-10 overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
                    <table class="w-full text-sm">
                        <thead class="text-left bg-zinc-100/75 font-semibold text-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-900/50 dark:text-zinc-300">
                            <tr>
                                <th scope="col" class="w-1/5 px-4 py-3">Property</th>
                                <th scope="col" class="w-2/5 px-4 py-3">Description</th>
                                <th scope="col" class="w-1/5 px-4 py-3">Type</th>
                                <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-3">Default</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody class="divide-y divide-zinc-200 dark:divide-zinc-800">
                            <tr class="align-top">
                                <td class="px-4 py-4"><code class="font-mono font-medium text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400">Items</code></td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Required source rows serialized into the DataTable transport.</td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4"><code class="font-mono text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400">IReadOnlyList&lt;TItem&gt;</code></td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4 text-zinc-500"><code class="font-mono">Array.Empty&lt;TItem&gt;()</code></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr class="align-top">
                                <td class="px-4 py-4"><code class="font-mono font-medium text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400">Config</code></td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Required table configuration containing <code>Columns</code>, <code>Features</code>, and <code>InitialState</code>.</td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4"><code class="font-mono text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400">RzDataTableConfig&lt;TItem&gt;</code></td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4 text-zinc-500"><code class="font-mono">required</code></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr class="align-top">
                                <td class="px-4 py-4"><code class="font-mono font-medium text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400">RowIdSelector</code></td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Required member-access expression used to derive stable row ids. Values must be non-empty and unique.</td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4"><code class="font-mono text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400">Expression&lt;Func&lt;TItem, object?&gt;&gt;</code></td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4 text-zinc-500"><code class="font-mono">required</code></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr class="align-top">
                                <td class="px-4 py-4"><code class="font-mono font-medium text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400">ChildContent</code></td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Author-provided markup that renders headers, rows, cells, controls, empty states, and pagination from Alpine projections.</td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4"><code class="font-mono text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400">RenderFragment?</code></td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4 text-zinc-500"><code class="font-mono">null</code></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr class="align-top">
                                <td class="px-4 py-4"><code class="font-mono font-medium text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400">LoadStrategy</code></td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Inherited Alpine loading strategy rendered as <code>x-load</code> when non-empty.</td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4"><code class="font-mono text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400">string</code></td>
                                <td class="px-4 py-4 text-zinc-500"><code class="font-mono">"eager"</code></td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="my-8 py-2">
                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H2" QuickReferenceTitle="Alpine API" class="scroll-mt-20">Alpine API</RzHeading>
                <RzParagraph><strong>Rendering state</strong>: <code>headerGroups</code>, <code>rows</code>, <code>footerGroups</code>, <code>hasRows</code>, <code>isEmpty</code>, and <code>selectedRowCount</code>.</RzParagraph>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li><code>headerGroups</code> — one entry per header row (<code>id</code>, <code>headers</code>); grouped columns produce several. Each header is a TanStack header: <code>header.id</code>, <code>header.colSpan</code>, <code>header.isPlaceholder</code>, <code>header.column</code>.</li>
                    <li><code>rows</code> — the rows of the current page after filtering and sorting: <code>id</code> (your row id), <code>row</code> (the TanStack row, for <code>selection.*</code> and <code>row.original</code>) and <code>cells</code> (visible cells: <code>cell.id</code>, <code>cell.column</code>, <code>cell.getValue()</code>).</li>
                    <li><code>footerGroups</code> — like <code>headerGroups</code>, for footers.</li>
                    <li>These are recomputed whenever TanStack state changes, so <code>x-for</code> loops and bindings over them update by themselves.</li>
                </ul>
                <RzParagraph>
                    <strong>Rendering helpers</strong>: <code>x-flexrender="_flex.header(header)"</code>, <code>_flex.cell(cell)</code> and
                    <code>_flex.footer(footer)</code> render the column's TanStack definition into the element you put the directive on.
                    String headers, footers and default cells render as text; a renderer that returns <code>flex.html(...)</code> renders
                    HTML (trusted content only). This is how column definitions from C# reach markup you author.
                </RzParagraph>
                <RzParagraph><strong>Advanced/internal</strong>: <code>table</code> (escape hatch to the TanStack instance), <code>_stateVersion</code>, and other <code>_flex</code> members. These are not covered by compatibility guarantees.</RzParagraph>

                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H3">Sorting API (<code>sort.*</code>)</RzHeading>
                <ul>
                    <li><code>sort.can(header)</code> — whether a header can sort. <a href="https://tanstack.com/table/latest/docs/api/features/sorting#getcansort" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">[Ref]</a></li>
                    <li><code>sort.direction(header)</code> — current sort direction for the header.</li>
                    <li><code>sort.toggle(header)</code> — toggles sorting for the header. <a href="https://tanstack.com/table/latest/docs/api/features/sorting#togglesorting" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">[Ref]</a></li>
                    <li><code>sort.ariaSort(header)</code> — mapped ARIA value from current sort state.</li>
                    <li><code>sort.columnName(header)</code> — the column's display name (its header text, or its id).</li>
                    <li><code>sort.nextLabel(header)</code> — English text for the next sort action ("Sort ascending"), for a tooltip; not used as the button's name.</li>
                </ul>

                <RzHeading Level="HeadingLevel.H3">Selection API (<code>selection.*</code>)</RzHeading>
                <ul>
                    <li><code>selection.canSelect(row)</code> / <code>selection.isSelected(row)</code> / <code>selection.isSomeSelected(row)</code> — row-level selection queries. <a href="https://tanstack.com/table/latest/docs/api/features/row-selection#getcanselect" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">[Ref]</a></li>
                    <li><code>selection.setRowSelected(row, value)</code> — set row selection state. <a href="https://tanstack.com/table/latest/docs/api/features/row-selection#toggleselected" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">[Ref]</a></li>
                    <li><code>selection.setRowSelectedById(rowId, value)</code> — set row selection from a stable serialized row id, used by generated <code>rowSelection</code> cells.</li>
                    <li><code>selection.allPageRowsSelected()</code>, <code>selection.somePageRowsSelected()</code>, <code>selection.setAllPageRows(value)</code> — page-scoped selection helpers. <a href="https://tanstack.com/table/latest/docs/api/features/row-selection#getisallpagerowsselected" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">[Ref]</a></li>
